    "notes": "Reviewed on H3 video. Idle v1, attack v1 and death v1 are clean. Hit v1 shed flying leaves and lost frames to plate pulses; hit v2, which says nothing breaks off, is clean. Defend v1 snapped into the shield wall in one frame; defend v3, guided only by the final guard and told to brace smoothly over about a second, closes the shields steadily. Cast v1 whipped the limbs out and back with blurred frames; cast v2, guided through the painted cast poses, spreads and lowers them steadily. The walk keeps the published clip."
